{
  "name": "Google Sheets: create Social Poster drafts from ready rows, optionally scheduled",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "7be40242-5e80-58ea-9b6e-32e05c4ffc17",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -320,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### How it works\nA schedule reads your Google Sheet and takes only rows with status `ready` and a caption. For each row, “Create the draft” saves a draft in Social Poster. “Write the status” then writes `draft`, `scheduled` or `error` and the draft id back to the row. An error on one row does not stop the others.\n\n### Draft or scheduled\nThe default is `mode` = `draft`: the workflow only creates a draft and schedules or publishes nothing. The link to view it is in the output of “Create the draft” under `draft.app_draft_url`. To schedule posts, set `mode` to `schedule`. “Schedule the draft” then schedules it `minutesFromNow` minutes later (at least 5) and confirms it. If your team requires approval, it waits under “Waiting for you”. There is no immediate publishing.\n\n### Setup\nThis template uses the unverified community node `n8n-nodes-social-poster` (tested with version 0.1.1). It runs on self-hosted n8n only, not on n8n Cloud. Install it under Settings → Community Nodes → Install. Guide: https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/community-nodes/installation/\nCreate “Social Poster API” credentials. You get the key in Social Poster under the account menu → AI access → API key for n8n. The base URL is `https://app.social-poster.io` without `/mcp`.\nCreate Google Sheets credentials and a sheet with these headers in row 1: `Caption`, `Link`, `MediaURLs`, `Title`, `Status`, `DraftRef`, `ScheduledAt`. In “Settings”, enter the sheet ID, sheet name and account reference (`acc_…`). Set one test row to `ready` and run the workflow once.\n\n### Customization\nDo not set too many rows to `ready` at once: the key allows 10 draft changes and 3 publishing steps per minute.",
        "height": 820,
        "width": 680,
        "color": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "adfc24f6-871e-52b0-ae1d-f6abfb4fefac",
      "name": "Schedule and settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## What you need to change\nInterval, sheet ID, sheet name, account reference, `mode` (default `draft`) and `minutesFromNow`.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "14205488-cb40-560d-8d52-00cb8c4c790e",
      "name": "Find ready rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1040,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Only status ready\nOnly rows with status `ready` and a caption continue.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c4c96276-90fc-512d-b8b4-33461ea7d460",
      "name": "Draft, schedule, write back",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1600,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Draft, optionally scheduled\nEach row becomes a draft. With `mode` = `schedule`, “Schedule the draft” schedules it. “Write the status” sets `draft`, `scheduled` or `error`.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 1060,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "258c918d-d0b5-5876-81e6-59d6690348e4",
      "name": "Note about X",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1880,
        640
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Review X (Twitter) posts yourself. Leave “X Content Reviewed” off in “Schedule the draft” until a person has checked the exact text and media.",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4970ca50-4dcf-486a-943c-d2a2dc330254",
      "name": "Every 15 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "45cf6481-6d6b-4e21-8bc7-5d1101b4c3ed",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        800,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
